{"2985450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Umigame", "steam_appid": 2985450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For 1-2 Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/991c385b25e3d307a0fc2513bef67a08.poster.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/991c385b25e3d307a0fc2513bef67a08.webm?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/991c385b25e3d307a0fc2513bef67a08.mp4?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The deeper you go into the <strong>Haunted Swamp</strong>, the more you feel Witch Maeve’s influence. <strong>She has bent the creatures here to her will</strong>, turning them into <strong>cursed abominations</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want to break free, you’ll have to become stronger.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/5caa493627529043f1c89959fb2b8638.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/12ccd9f2a1b7c55b560cee078b9e4e3c.poster.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/12ccd9f2a1b7c55b560cee078b9e4e3c.webm?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/12ccd9f2a1b7c55b560cee078b9e4e3c.mp4?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a water spirit in this co-op action roguelite <strong>for one or two players</strong>. Explore a haunted swamp where decay and beauty intertwine, battle relentless enemies, and adapt to ever-changing challenges while evolving your powers with every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for thrilling boss battles that will put your skills to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/2c1394f1c0100421430f76228f0427ce.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/8639862a8b5a1a65d5acd1e1598d863f.poster.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/8639862a8b5a1a65d5acd1e1598d863f.webm?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/8639862a8b5a1a65d5acd1e1598d863f.mp4?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon and command <strong>Guardians</strong>, natural turrets that fight alongside you, turning the battlefield into a dynamic mix of strategy and chaos. Experiment with unique abilities, adapt your tactics on the fly, or combine powers with a friend to overcome increasingly dangerous threats as the swamp itself fights back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/999f50052e8c2f1383ed1c7580073afc.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/e06c917df2154424e3976352361b5fdd.poster.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/e06c917df2154424e3976352361b5fdd.webm?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/e06c917df2154424e3976352361b5fdd.mp4?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardians: </strong>Deploy and modify nature’s guardians to change the course of the fight</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unique Playable Heroes: </strong>Each with their own weapons and special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skills &amp; Items : </strong>Stack absurd builds, experiment with upgrades, and break the game in the best way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong>: Improve your <strong>character</strong> and <strong>guardians</strong> over time, <strong>unlocking new powers</strong> and upgrades that carry across runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Online Co-op (1 or 2 players)</strong>: Team up with a friend and fight through the chaos together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> : Every run brings <strong>new enemies</strong>, challenges, and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty System:</strong> An unlockable <strong>difficulty system</strong> keeps every run fresh and challenging once you finish the game</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c