re you feel Witch Maeve’s influence. <strong>She has bent the creatures here to her will</strong>, turning them into <strong>cursed abominations</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want to break free, you’ll have to become stronger.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/5caa493627529043f1c89959fb2b8638.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/12ccd9f2a1b7c55b560cee078b9e4e3c.poster.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/12ccd9f2a1b7c55b560cee078b9e4e3c.webm?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/12ccd9f2a1b7c55b560cee078b9e4e3c.mp4?t=1773932253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a water spirit in this co-op action roguelite <strong>for one or two players</strong>. Explore a haunted swamp where decay and beauty intertwine, battle relentless enemies, and adapt to ever-changing challenges while evolving your powers with every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for thrilling boss battles that will put your skills to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985450/extras/2c1394f1c0100421430f76228f0427ce.avif?t=1773932253\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic